Package: ttt
Version: 1.13.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: git, ripgrep, curl, tar, gzip
Section: editors
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/termuxvoid/ttt-termux
Description: Terminal-based code editor with syntax highlighting
 TTT (Terminal Text Tool) is a single-binary terminal editor with
 multi-cursor editing, file explorer, workspace search, Git integration,
 LSP support, themes, and Lua plugins. TermuxVoid builds it for every
 Termux architecture.
